msgid "Apps: `zfr rename <dir>` then `zfr add <puff>`; VERSION matches debian/changelog (git describe may differ)."
msgstr "應用：先 `zfr rename <dir>` 再 `zfr add <puff>`；VERSION 與 debian/changelog 相符（git describe 可能不同）。"

